Z||000002||Predator||12-11-2001||09:49 AM||||I have not done this yet, but have heard of others. I am planning on placing mine under the drivers side vent where the air can, and gas condenser would be. The plumbing would be pretty simple from there for my setup.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero4_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Mr.Frosty||12-11-2001||10:00 AM||||I placed mine under the driver side engine cover.I had to cut out the inner fender area where the air cannister mounted to with a cut off wheel.I laid it flat over the new opening.Air flow should be pretty good there.I'm looking into how I'm going to do the pipe routing from the intercooler back to the throttle body.<P>------------------<BR>85 GT Turbo intercooled||||reg||1
